# Repo-root .dockerignore shared by the UKBatch.Server image AND the Sample.WorkerMode worker images
# (all use `build.context: .`). DO NOT exclude `samples/` — the worker Dockerfiles COPY their own
# sample sources from this context. The server image simply does not COPY samples/.
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
artifacts/
.git
.github
*.user
reports/
documentation/
